C:\builds\wireshark\wireshark\epan\dissectors\packet-dvb-s2-bb.c(1148,54): warning C4244: '=': conversion from 'guint16' to 'guint8', possible loss of data
C:\builds\wireshark\wireshark\epan\dissectors\packet-dvb-s2-bb.c(1148,54): warning C4244:                 labeltype = subpacket_data->labeltype; 

should labeltype be guint16 in dissect_dvb_s2_gse()?

